# No `.web` / `.native` file splits

Do not create platform-specific files (`*.web.ts`, `*.web.tsx`, `*.native.ts`). Put web and native in one file and branch with `Platform.OS` or `Platform.select` imported directly from `react-native` so Expo can platform-shake.

```ts
import { Platform } from 'react-native';

if (Platform.OS !== 'web') {
  require('expo-sqlite/localStorage/install');
}
```
